1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,400
Two keepers share a tournament course.
Both dials show the same five gates.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:07,800
Press A on the west side or L on the east.
Flash when the beam reaches the golden gate.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,500
A flash near the centre earns up to 100 points.
Each keeper gets one flash per ship.

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,100
West guides the third ship.
East flashes outside the gate and scores zero.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,900
Five signals decide the heat.
The same course can be replayed at another station.

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,700
West wins, 414 to 275.
The harbour log shows the score for every ship.
